OL,3,GNEWSAThe making of Moby Dick - when
OL,4,AHollywood came to a tiny Welsh harbour
OL,5,
OL,6,FAlthough Fishguard itself does not
OL,7,Ffeature as filming was done out at sea,
OL,8,Flocals still recall when Hollywood's
OL,9,Fstars took over the town.
